<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- University of Pittsburgh.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- University of Pittsburgh.</headline>
<text>
<p>UNIVERSITY OF PITTSBURGH</p>
<p>RE: $131,385,000</p>
<p>OF THE COMMONWEALTH SYSTEM OF HIGHER EDUCATION</p>
<p>UNIVERSITY REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES B OF 1997</p>
<p>Effective at 3:00 P.M. E.D.T., Monday, July 21, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>PNC Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Mellon Financial Markets Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
